# ── local private configuration / credentials (2026-11-03) ────────────
# User-level image profiles, tokens, PicGo config copies and absolute personal
# paths must live outside the repository. These are defence-in-depth only:
# .gitignore cannot protect files that are already tracked.
.env.local
.env.*.local
config.local.*
config.private.*
*.private.json
picgo.config.json
.picgo/
